+// ── CONTINUITY WATCHDOG (Phase 3) ────────────────────────────────────
+// Runs after the indexer finishes updating a chapter (not during writing).
+// One LLM call per chapter, comparing its new data against the full
+// character/plot/timeline index. Findings surface as non-intrusive cards
+// in the PubPartner chat with Dismiss / Flag for later / Fix now actions.
+// Dismissed findings are never re-flagged.
